# Frontend data and UI

- Feature screens still use mock data (`src/lib/mockData.ts`) unless `.agent` says the screen is wired to Laravel.
- When calling Laravel, use `publicApi`, `participantApi`, or `organizerApi` from `src/lib/api.ts`. Do not call axios/fetch from a page.
- Never restore Supabase clients, RPCs, or `supabase.functions.invoke`.
- Keep React Query keys stable when a hook already exists; invalidate after mutations.
- Roles: `useAuth` = current session; wrap organizer pages with `OrganizerOnly`.
- Public cinematic modules stay as they are visually: `why_attend | schedule | speakers | location | faq | sponsors | custom`.
- Ticket prices are labels. Do not add a fake checkout.
- Icons: lucide-react. `react-icons/si` dropped Slack and Twilio.
- CSS: no `@import` after `@tailwind`. Fonts belong in `index.html`.
